{"speciesId":559,"names":{"fr":"Baggiguane","es":"Scraggy","en":"Scraggy","ja":"ズルッグ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il remonte sa peau jusqu’à son cou pour se protéger. Elle a une constitution élastique qui absorbe les coups."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quiconque a le malheur de croiser son regard se prend un coup de tête. Il a le crâne très dur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It immediately headbutts anyone that makes eye contact with it. Its skull is massively thick."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il remonte sa peau jusqu’à son cou pour se protéger. Elle a une constitution élastique qui absorbe les coups."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se sube la piel hasta el cuello para defenderse. Su elasticidad, similar a la de una goma, reduce el daño recibido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"皮を 首まで 引き上げて 防御の 姿勢。ゴムのような 弾力で ダメージを 減らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses coups de tête sont sa fierté. Seul problème : sa tête est un peu trop lourde, et il perd souvent l’équilibre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está orgulloso de su sólido cráneo. Reparte cabezazos a diestro y siniestro con tal vehemencia que él mismo se marea."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頑丈な 頭蓋骨が 自慢。 いきなり 頭突きを かましてくるが 重さで 自分も フラフラしてる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il remonte sa peau jusqu’à son cou pour se protéger. Elle a une constitution élastique qui absorbe les coups."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se sube la piel hasta el cuello para defenderse. Su elasticidad, similar a la de una goma, reduce el daño recibido."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"皮を 首まで 引き上げて 防御の 姿勢。ゴムのような 弾力で ダメージを 減らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses coups de tête sont sa fierté. Seul problème : sa tête est un peu trop lourde, et il perd souvent l’équilibre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Está orgulloso de su sólido cráneo. Reparte cabezazos a diestro y siniestro con tal vehemencia que él mismo se marea."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頑丈な 頭蓋骨が 自慢。 いきなり 頭突きを かましてくるが 重さで 自分も フラフラしてる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il traîne en bandes et distribue des coups de tête à ceux qui osent croiser son regard."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se desplaza con lentitud en pequeños grupos y se lía a cabezazos a la mínima que alguien le cruza la mirada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They move in small groups, walking around lazily. Anyone who makes eye contact gets smacked with a headbutt."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"数匹のグループで 行動する。 ちんたら 歩きまわり 目が 合った 相手に いきなり 頭突きを かます。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pour se protéger, il remonte sa peau plissée jusqu’à son cou. Plus la peau est longue, plus Baggiguane inspirera de respect."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se sube la piel arrugada hasta el cuello para protegerse. Parece que los ejemplares con la piel más larga son los más respetados."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It stretches its saggy skin up to its neck to protect itself. The saggier their skin, the more respect they garner."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"だるんと のびた 皮を 首まで 引っ張りあげて ガード。 皮が のびている 個体ほど 偉いらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"C’est un Pokémon dangereux qui distribue des coups de tête à quiconque ose croiser son regard."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"No tiene reparos en liarse a cabezazos con quien se le ponga por delante, por lo que es peligroso cruzar la mirada con él."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"視線が 合ったら 危険！ 相手を 選ばず 頭突きで 襲ってくる 厄介者だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se protège grâce à sa peau robuste. On dit que quand celle-ci ne peut plus s’étirer davantage, c’est qu’il est sur le point d’évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su robusta piel le sirve de protección. Cuando ya no puede estirarse más, es señal de que va a evolucionar pronto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It protects itself with its durable skin. It’s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"丈夫な 皮で 身を 守る。 皮が 伸びきるとき 進化を 迎えると いわれる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":559,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0]